.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_36.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/810","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.10.9911171818220.12375-100000%40ray.compu-aid.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0352.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0352","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0352.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0352.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-q62p-v3wf-j428/GHSA-q62p-v3wf-j428.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0352.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ca6a7de2-127a-4a11-a35b-b8891f9a3599.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0906.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0060","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0073","title":"Microsoft Windows RTF 解析器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/NT 4.0 等系统自带的 Riched 组件在处理 RTF 格式文档时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向用户发送包含特制控制字的恶意 .rtf 文件，诱使用户使用受影响系统打开后触发缓冲区溢出，导致系统服务崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 95/98、Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows Terminal Server 4.0 等多个版本，用户需安装安全更新或避免打开来源不明的 RTF 文件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0073"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:56Z","remediation":"受影响系统均已终止支持且无官方补丁。建议升级到 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019/2022 等受支持版本；若无法升级，应在邮件客户端和应用中禁用 RTF 格式渲染，改用纯文本模式处理富文本内容，并限制用户打开来源不明的 .rtf 文件（如通过组策略启用附件管理器阻止 rtf 扩展名）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ249973","http://xforce.iss.net/search.php3?type=2&pattern=win-malformed-rtf-control-word","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-005","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19633","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0073.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0073.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0073","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0073.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0073.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hp77-39hv-xf39/GHSA-hp77-39hv-xf39.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0073.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0508","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0165","title":"NEC Delegate 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Delegate 应用代理（Delegate application proxy）5.9.x及6.0.x版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务发送特制的网络请求触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛使用 Delegate 代理的服务器环境，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危，建议用户及时升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0165"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-13T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:08Z","remediation":"立即升级 Delegate（ETL Delegate）至 6.1.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复多个缓冲区溢出漏洞。若无法升级，需在防火墙层面限制仅受信 IP 地址可访问 Delegate 代理服务（默认端口 8080），并启用应用层输入长度校验作为临时缓解措施。由于该软件已停止维护，建议迁移至 Nginx 或 HAProxy 等仍在维护的代理服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/k-023.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=Pine.BSF.4.21.0002192249290.10784-100000%40freefall.freebsd.org","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4195","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19634","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0165.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0165","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0165.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0165.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/305.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/exploit.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/delegate_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0165.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/web-misc.rules","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Aries/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.221"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0274","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0274.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0330","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/98 UNC 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Windows 95/98 网络软件在处理 UNC 路径时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含超长文件名字符串的特制 URL 请求触发该漏洞，导致系统拒绝服务或任意代码执行。攻击条件为诱使用户访问恶意网页或网络共享，无需身份认证即可利用。该漏洞影响 Windows 95 和 Windows 98 系统，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0330"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:29Z","remediation":"Windows 95/98 已停止支持且无官方补丁。建议立即升级至 Windows 10 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在网络防火墙层面阻止外部对 139/TCP、445/TCP 端口的访问，并禁用 Microsoft 网络的文件和打印机共享功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-049","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19608","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0330.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0330","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0330.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0330.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3