ActiveX 控件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-048","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19603","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0329.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0329","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0329.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0329.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ad1f28a6575460b2b8dc02e086c9a35eb31ea1f4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-65p6-f2x3-5fgg/GHSA-65p6-f2x3-5fgg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json","https://github.com/bibliotxt/bibliotxt/blob/07bb3ac8e74e6f78514faabae1ce10b662cf48a1/zines/trenchcoat-diaries/tcpaper2.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0329.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0272.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0272.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0272.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0374","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0374.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0363","title":"Linux cdwtools 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux cdwtools 0.93 及更早版本中存在不安全的临时文件处理漏洞，由于程序在 /tmp 目录下创建临时文件时未进行充分的权限检查和文件名随机化处理，本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击或竞争条件（TOCTOU）方式，在 /tmp 目录中预创建恶意符号链接指向系统关键文件，诱使以 root 权限运行的 cdwtools 进程覆盖或写入任意文件，从而将自身权限提升至 root。该漏洞利用需要本地用户身份且攻击复杂度较高，但成功利用后可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0363"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:33Z","remediation":"立即将 cdwtools 升级至 0.94 或更高版本（如已停止维护，建议彻底移除 cdwtools 软件包）。在无法升级的情况下，可通过在 /etc/fstab 中为 /tmp 分区添加 nosuid、noexec 挂载选项来缓解本地提权风险，同时确保 /tmp 目录权限为 1777（粘滞位已设置）。对于仍在使用该组件的老旧 SUSE Linux 系统，应安装 SUSE 安全公告中提供的补丁包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_25.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/738","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0363.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0363","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0363.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0363.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c91b667a34faaae3b0a33048a22e9eae624cf0e4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3r58-vgpx-8w42/GHSA-3r58-vgpx-8w42.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0363.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0374.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0305","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0305.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0362","title":"SuSE Linux cdwtools 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux cdwtools 093 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 cwdtools 程序发送特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 S.u.S.E. Linux 6.1/6.2 系统，攻击者需要拥有本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。目前已公开的利用代码可通过 ExploitDB 获取。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0362"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:33Z","remediation":"升级 cdwtools 至 0.93 以上版本，或安装 SUSE 官方提供的安全补丁。由于 SUSE Linux 6.x 已停止支持，建议将系统升级至受支持版本。临时缓解措施可移除 cdwtools 相关二进制文件的 setuid 权限：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/cdw*`，限制本地普通用户以 root 权限执行该程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_25.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/738","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19565","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0362.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0362","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0362.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0362.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g52w-p8hr-3x85/GHSA-g52w-p8hr-3x85.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0362.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0305.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0888","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0888.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0327","title":"Microsoft Virtual Machine Java沙箱逃逸远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Virtual Machine（VM）存在Java沙箱逃逸漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造包含非法类型转换操作的恶意Java Applet，诱使用户访问恶意网页触发漏洞，从而突破Java安全沙箱的限制并在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响Microsoft Virtual Machine多个版本，CVSS评分7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0327"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:29Z","remediation":"升级 Microsoft VM 至 build 2442（2000 系列）或 build 3188（3000 系列）及以上版本。该补丁随 Microsoft Security Bulletin MS99-045 发布，可通过 Windows Update 获取。由于 Microsoft 已于 2007 年终止对 Microsoft Java VM 的支持，建议彻底卸载 Microsoft VM 并迁移至最新版 Java Runtime Environment（JRE），同时在浏览器中禁用 Java Applet 支持以彻底消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93993545118416&w=2","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-045","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0327.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0327","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0327.md","https://github